export const tracks={piano:'钢琴',guitar:'吉他',violin:'小提琴',bass:'贝斯',drums:'鼓点',melody:'电子旋律',harmony:'氛围和声'};
const clamp=(v,a,b,f)=>typeof v==='number'&&Number.isFinite(v)?Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v)):f;
export function normalizeSegments(value){const items=(Array.isArray(value)?value:[]).slice(0,16).map(p=>{const start=clamp(p?.start,0,.95,0);return {start,end:clamp(p?.end,start+.01,1,1)}}).sort((a,b)=>a.start-b.start),merged=[];for(const s of items){const last=merged.at(-1);if(last&&s.start<last.end-.00001)last.end=Math.max(last.end,s.end);else merged.push({...s})}return merged.length?merged:[{start:0,end:1}]}
export function normalizeMix(value){const result={};for(const k of Object.keys(tracks)){const p=value?.[k]||{},start=clamp(p.start,0,.95,0),segments=normalizeSegments(Array.isArray(p.segments)?p.segments:[{start,end:clamp(p.end,start+.05,1,1)}]);result[k]={start:segments[0].start,end:segments[0].end,segments,volume:clamp(p.volume,0,1.5,1)}}return result}
export function gainAt(mix,time,duration){let gain=0;for(const {start,end} of mix.segments||[mix]){const a=start*duration,b=end*duration;if(time<a||time>=b)continue;const fade=Math.min(.15,(b-a)/4);gain=Math.max(gain,mix.volume*Math.min(1,start>0?(time-a)/fade:1,end<1?(b-time)/fade:1))}return gain}
export function gainPoints(mix,duration){const segments=mix.segments||[mix],points=[[0,segments[0].start>0?0:mix.volume]];for(const {start,end} of segments){const a=start*duration,b=end*duration,fade=Math.min(.15,(b-a)/4);if(start>0)points.push([a,0],[a+fade,mix.volume]);if(end<1)points.push([b-fade,mix.volume],[b,0])}points.push([duration,segments.at(-1).end<1?0:mix.volume]);return points}
export function arrangementPreset(kind,enabled){const mix=normalizeMix();if(kind==='build'){for(const k of Object.keys(mix))mix[k].start=({piano:0,guitar:.18,violin:.52,bass:.22,drums:.35,melody:0,harmony:0})[k];mix.harmony.volume=.65}else if(kind==='dialogue'){mix.piano.end=.53;mix.guitar.start=.45;mix.violin.start=.74;mix.melody.end=.5;mix.harmony.volume=.55;mix.drums.start=.5}else if(kind==='intimate'){mix.drums.volume=.35;mix.bass.volume=.6;mix.harmony.volume=.45;mix.violin.start=.65;mix.guitar.volume=.7}for(const m of Object.values(mix))m.segments=[{start:m.start,end:m.end}];return normalizeMix(mix)}
